  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sahel Regional Fund to support projects in Sahelian countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Fund will deliver grants to NGOs and Civil Society Organisations (CSOs) in the Sahel region, focusing on the geographic hotspots of most acute humanitarian need. Activities include: providing access to food security and livelihoods, health and nutrition, water, hygiene and sanitation, education services, and strengthening local protection systems.</narrative>
  </description>
